  msgInstalling: Live try-on needs Google Play Services for AR. Follow the steps
    on screen.
  msgStarting: Starting live try-on...
  msgLookingForFace: Looking for your face. Hold the phone in front of you.
  msgTracking: Live try-on. Turn your head to see the colour from the side.
  msgSwitchedOff: Live try-on closed the app last time, so the guided preview is
    used on this phone.
  msgFaceHeld: Face lost for a moment. Turn back towards the camera.
  msgLiveFailed: Live tracking could not start ({0}). Using the guided preview.
